      },
      "reason": "Backend is the immediate dependency of gateway per topology; discovering its actual metric names first avoids inventing metric names and can reveal a cause-specific health signal versus the downstream gateway symptom.",
      "expected_discriminator": "Cause-specific backend health signals (saturation/latency onset) versus the gateway-only downstream 5xx symptom would separate a backend failure from a gateway-local problem."
